      {
        "id": 187937,
        "name": "Blackfang108",
        "username": "Blackfang108",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-11T19:27:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"mwc146\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n mwc146:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yeah, not everyone is going to be able to go all out every game. Sometimes someone gets stuck as just being solid, reliable damage.It could've been worse – all her damaging cards could've ended up on the bottom of the deck.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Yeah, she didn't make out NEARLY as bad as Setback did in For the Watch.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I also got a Shotgun out late, and still had one of her Unloads.</p>",
