        "id": 187938,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-12T00:55:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I realized too late that I had been neglecting Expat and could have done even more with her. Given that she had two guns early on, plus a couple of Unloads, she could have been wrecking house with a +1 from Syncopated Onslaught. Naturalist didn't do as many hits per round, surprisingly.</p>",
