        "id": 187939,
        "name": "deddragon",
        "username": "deddragon",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/deddragon/{size}/2335_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-12T16:40:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Minted, everyone up but in single digits.</p>\n<p>I had Naturalist stay in Croc form the entire game. He and Knyfe were doing the heavy hitting. I didn’t get Predator’s Eye, but thanks to 2 Vernal Sonatas they got to play their damaging One Shots three times each.</p>\n<p>Expatriette shot. I didn’t get any ammo, but she shot a lot anyway. The Unloads only netted 2 damage each, but since I got Deadline at -1hp and likely wouldn’t have survived another villain turn It was perfect.</p>\n<p>I had Argent Adept destroying environment cards on Deadline’s front side to lessen the damage when he flipped. He also gave extra card plays/draws and was critical to retrieving Energy Burn and Threatening Stomp from the trash.</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:13:48.694Z",
