      {
        "id": 187940,
        "name": "fabikw",
        "username": "fabikw",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/ea5d25/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-13T05:07:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint.</p><p>Only AA left with 1 HP. The others went when deadline still had 7 HP and it was not easy to deal damage just with AA. However, I managed to pull the 1 sonic damage song, as well as some +1 damage (between incapped abilities and his song). Between that and multiple power uses, I managed to win.</p><p>I just focused all my attack power on Deadline, with croc Naturalist making use of the nemesis +1 as well as KNYFE dealing most of the damage.</p>",
        "post_number": 25,
